n GCC 4.9 as shipped in Fedora 21, starting with PWD at the glm repository root:\n\n```\nmkdir build\ncd build\ng++ -m32 -O2 -Wall -I .. ../test/gtc/gtc_integer.cpp\n./a.out ; echo $?\n```\n\nBy changing the optimization level, at least results 0, 1 and 4 can be obtained on my system. Passing the -ffloat-store option to GCC makes the test always succeed.\n\nThis could also be related to issue #212.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/296/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/296/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/68882421","html_url":"https://github.com/g-truc/glm/issues/212#issuecomment-68882421","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/212","id":68882421,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY4ODgyNDIx","user":{"login":"muep","id":47061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muep","html_url":"https://github.com/muep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-01-06T15:47:07Z","updated_at":"2015-01-06T15:47:07Z","body":"Just a note tha